'''Bingo Display''' is a {{Common}} Cosmetic that shows the player's total {{Bingo Points}}.

== Obtaining ==
It is bought from the [[Bingo#Bingo Shop|{{Aqua|Bingo Shop}}]] for {{Bingo Points|50}}.

== Usage ==
Using a '''Bingo Display''' will display the amount of {{Bingo Points}} they have.

